            "text": "<p>Hirshleifers is a luxury retailer based in Manhasset, New York, specializing in high-end fashion, accessories, and jewelry from top global designers. Known for its curated selection and personalized service, Hirshleifers offers an exclusive shopping experience, featuring pieces from the world’s most prestigious brands. With a rich family heritage, it’s a sought-after destination for fashion connoisseurs seeking unique and luxurious finds.</p><p><strong>Opening hours:</strong><br/>Monday – Saturday: 10am – 6pm<br/>Sunday: 12am - 6pm</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hirshleifers/@40.7960767,-73.673825,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c2888c2a701d03:0x10f08607ab63601b!8m2!3d40.7960727!4d-73.6712501!16s%2Fg%2F1q2vy3r6l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hirshleifers\">2080 Northern Blvd.<br/>Manhasset, NY 11030, USA</a></p>",
